{"id":"fichu","lemma":"fichu","pos":"adj","rank":2225,"glosses":["lousy, rotten, hell of a","done for","put together, rigged out, got up"],"ipa":"/fi.ʃy/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/43/Fr-fichu.ogg/Fr-fichu.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"fichue","masculinePlural":"fichus","femininePlural":"fichues"},"examples":[{"text":"Je suis fichu.","en":"I'm doomed.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Nous sommes fichus.","en":"We're goners.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"Mes parents m'ont fichu dehors.","en":"My parents have kicked me out of the house.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"relative","l":"parent"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"outside"}]},{"text":"Tout est fichu à cause de toi.","en":"Everything is ruined because of you.","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"you"}],"phrases":[[3,6,"because of"]]},{"text":"Tu m'as fichu la trouille.","en":"You freaked me out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/214462","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"fear"}]}]}